guide forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil
title Teldrassil
faction Alliance
race NightElf
levels 1-11
zone Teldrassil
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for the Night Elf start, visit 1
# (Teldrassil, level 1 to about 11). The route goes on to Westfall.
#
# Flow: Shadowglen (Aldrassil, Shadowthread Cave, the moonwell) -> Dolanaar
# (hearth) -> Zenn and the Starbreeze moonwell -> Dolanaar -> east loop:
# Starbreeze Village, Lake Al'Ameth -> Dolanaar -> west loop: Fel Rock, the
# road ambushers, Ban'ethil Barrow Den, the Pools of Arlithrien, Gnarlpine
# Hold -> hearth -> Ferocitas -> Dolanaar ->
# Sentinel Eralya -> the Oracle Glade (Arynia's harpies) -> Ursal ->
# Dolanaar -> Lake Al'Ameth -> Dolanaar -> Sentinel Eralya -> Darnassus (the
# Cenarion Enclave, the Temple of the Moon) -> Rut'theran Village (flight path)
# -> boat to Auberdine -> boat to Stormwind -> Westfall.
#
# Deviations from the export, each a shorter walk with the same quests:
# - The Relics of Wakening (483) is done on the one trip into Ban'ethil
#   Barrow Den with Oben Rageclaw and Lynessa: Starbreeze (475, 476) and the
#   dresser (2438) come before the west loop instead of after it.
# - Timberling Seeds and Sprouts (918, 919) are taken and done on the first
#   visit to Denalan, with the lasher fronds, instead of a later trip.
# - The Glowing Fruit (930) waits for the last lake visit (931, 2399), and
#   Ferocitas comes straight after the hearth, so the lake is visited twice,
#   not three times.
# - Nessa Shadowsong (6344) is added: Mydrannul stands on the path through
#   Darnassus, and the game offers The Bounty of Teldrassil (6341) only after
#   it.
# - The Sisterhood of Elune (98391), never turned in by the export, is turned
#   in to Sister Aquinne beside the Rut'theran portal.
# - Flight to Auberdine (6342) is turned in at Laird on the Auberdine dock
#   while changing boats, not on the later Darkshore visit.
# - Dolanaar Delivery (2159) is taken from Porthannius when you leave
#   Shadowglen for Dolanaar, not with the Aldrassil pickups before the cave:
#   he stands by the path out of the glen, about 380 yards out of the way
#   there and 65 on the way down to Dolanaar. 0.014 h sooner to 10 and to
#   20 under the simulator.
# - Added: The Enchanted Glade (937), Darkness in the Glade (98392) and The
#   Oracle Tree (98398) from Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the Oracle Glade
#   moonwell: every harpy lives around it. The chain's last steps go to
#   Fandral in Darnassus and are not taken (see "Left out").
# - Crown of the Earth (935, 1100 XP) is taken from Corithras after the
#   Amethyst Phial (7383) and handed to Fandral in the Cenarion Enclave on
#   the way through Darnassus; his Drained Vessel (98046) goes to Lariia and
#   her Moonwell Remnants (98065) to Tyrande, both in the Temple of the Moon.
#   Rellian Greenspyre (922), which the export took from Denalan and never
#   handed in, now goes to Rellian on that walk, just south of the Enclave.
#   Measured with sim compare against this guide without them: 0.09 h
#   sooner to 60 and to 30, 0.02 h later to 20.
#
# Order changes for the hand-made quest chains (a follow-up is offered only
# after its prerequisite is turned in):
# - The Goddess Provides (97979) is now taken after The Balance of Nature
#   (456) is turned in.
# - The Oracle Tree (98398) is now taken after Darkness in the Glade (98392)
#   is turned in.
# - The Great Tree Provides (99050) is now taken after Not Dead Yet (99047)
#   is turned in, on the last Dolanaar stop; its fronds come from the last
#   lake visit.
# - Easing Suffering (99073) is now taken after The Great Tree Provides
#   (99050) is turned in, and handed to Eralya on the way to Darnassus.
# - Recipe of the Kaldorei (4161) is taken from Zarrin after he teaches
#   Cooking (Camping 101: Cooking, 96634), not with the other Dolanaar
#   pickups: he offers it to cooks only (QuestieDB lists Cooking 1).
#
# Left out: Crown of the Earth (934): its Vial of Blessed Water has no known
# source, and 935 needs only the Amethyst Phial. Rellian's Tumors (923)
# would send you back into Teldrassil from Darnassus.
# Measured and left out (sim compare, each against the guide without it):
# Bounty: Gnarlpine Furbolg (490, Sentinel Shayla, in the new export), 0.08 h
# later to 60; Teldrassil (940, from the Oracle Tree Bark to Fandral), 0.01 h
# later, and with Fandral's Grove of the Ancients (952, to Onu in Darkshore)
# 0.18 h later.
# Eyes of the Sentinels (98067, Sentinel Dalia Sunblade in the Temple of the
# Moon) places owls at the city gate, the Craftsmen's Terrace inn, the bank
# and Cenarion Hold: a full lap of Darnassus for 660 XP, so it is not taken;
# do it if you want to learn the city. Twisted Hatred (98403, Tallonkai after
# Lord Melenas) is a level 12 elite group quest in the Cleft: not taken.
#
# Class quests, as class-only steps from the last Dolanaar stop (about 10.5):
# - Hunter: Etched Sigil (3117) to Ayanna Everstride at Aldrassil;
#   Dazalar's taming quests (6063, 6101, 6102: Tame Beast) around Dolanaar;
#   Training the Beast (6103) is handed to Jocaste in Darnassus.
# - Druid: Verdant Sigil (3120) to Mardant Strongoak at Aldrassil.
# - Druid: Heeding the Call (5925, Kal) to Moonglade (5921) at Darnassus;
#   Teleport: Moonglade and the Great Bear Spirit (5929), then Back to
#   Darnassus and Body and Heart (5931, 6001) at the Moonkin Stone by
#   Auberdine, moving by the Auberdine, Moonglade and Rut'theran flight
#   paths; Bear Form is handed in at Darnassus before the boat to Stormwind.
# - Priest: Returning Home (5629, Laurna Morninglight) to Priestess Alathea
#   in Darnassus: Starshards.
#   In Favor of Elune / Garments of the Moon (5622, 5621) reward a robe, not a
#   spell: not taken.
# - Warrior: the Defensive Stance quests (1638, 1639, 1640, 1665) on arrival
#   in Stormwind by the boat.
# - Level 1 class letters are taken: every class's sigil from Conservator
#   Ilthalaine (3116-3120) goes to its trainer at Aldrassil once The Balance
#   of Nature is handed in.
# - Druid, later: Aquatic Form and Cat Form in 03-darkshore and
#   06-ashenvale.
#
# No grind stops and no dungeons.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadowglen

step Aldrassil
  tip You start at the foot of Aldrassil, the great tree of Shadowglen.
  accept 458                                  -- Melithar Staghelm, by the path
  accept 456                                  -- Conservator Ilthalaine
  turnin 458                                  -- Tarindrella, south of the tree
  accept 459
  accept 97977

step The Balance of Nature
  tip Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars roam around Aldrassil. Grells carry Fel Moss in the woods west of the tree, where the Gnarlpine Totems stand.
  kill 2031 quest 456.1
  kill 1984 quest 456.2
  collect 3297 quest 459.1
  interact 668482 quest 97977.1               -- Gnarlpine Totem

