# Shadowthread Cave: "The eggs are at 57,26 / The cave is at 57,32"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=917, comments).
step Shadowthread Cave
  goto 57.0,32.0 "Shadowthread Cave"

step Webwood Egg and the antidote
  tip The Webwood Eggs lie at the back of Shadowthread Cave: take the central path, then left where it splits, up to the high ledge. Hyacinth Mushrooms drop from Grells, Moonpetal Lilies grow by the ponds north of Aldrassil.
  collect 5167 quest 917.1
  collect 10640 quest 3521.3                  -- Webwood Spiders
  collect 10639 quest 3521.1
  collect 10641 quest 3521.2

step Aldrassil
  turnin 917                                  -- Gilshalan Windwalker
  accept 920
  turnin 920                                  -- Tenaron Stormgrip, at the top of the tree
  accept 921
  turnin 3521                                 -- Dirania Silvershine
  accept 3522

step The moonwell and Iverron
  tip The moonwell sits north of Aldrassil; Iverron is a little further north-west. Iverron's Antidote lasts five minutes: fill the phial and go straight on to him.
  collect 5184 quest 921.1 @60.0,33.0         -- Use the Crystal Phial at the moonwell
  turnin 3522                                 -- Iverron

step Tenaron Stormgrip
  tip Back to the top of Aldrassil. The Lost Journal lies beside him.
  turnin 921
  accept 928
  accept 96630                                -- Lost Journal

step Porthannius
  tip Leave Shadowglen by the path south-east of Aldrassil: Porthannius stands beside it, where it goes down towards the road to Dolanaar.
  accept 2159                                 -- Porthannius

