step Zenn Foulhoof
  turnin 489

step Lake Al'Ameth
  tip South of Zenn. Denalan tends his saplings on the shore; Lasher Sproutlings and Timberlings wander around him, and the Timberling Sprouts grow among them.
  turnin 997                                  -- Denalan
  accept 918
  accept 919
  collect 5168 quest 918.1
  collect 5169 quest 919.1
