# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darnassus and Rut'theran

step Darnassus
  zone Darnassus
  tip Follow the road west into Darnassus. Mydrannul stands on the Craftsmen's Terrace just inside the city. Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is in the Cenarion Enclave at the north end of the city, Rellian Greenspyre just south of it; Lariia and Tyrande Whisperwind are in the Temple of the Moon at the south end. Sister Aquinne is in the west of the city, on the way to the pink portal down to Rut'theran.
  accept 6344                                 -- Mydrannul
  turnin 935                                  -- Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, in the Cenarion Enclave
  accept 98046
  turnin 6103 only Hunter                     -- Jocaste, in the Cenarion Enclave: Beast Training
  turnin 5925 only Druid                      -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker, in the Cenarion Enclave
  accept 5921 only Druid
  turnin 922                                  -- Rellian Greenspyre
  turnin 98046                                -- Lariia, in the Temple of the Moon
  accept 98065
  turnin 98065                                -- Tyrande Whisperwind, above Lariia
  turnin 5629 only Priest                     -- Priestess Alathea, in the Temple of the Moon: Starshards
  turnin 98391                                -- Sister Aquinne

step Rut'theran Village
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Take the portal down to Rut'theran Village. Nessa stands on the dock, Vesprystus by the hippogryphs.
  turnin 6344                                 -- Nessa Shadowsong
  accept 6341
