step Boat to Auberdine
  goto 54.79,96.81 "Boat to Auberdine"

step Moonglade
  only Druid
  zone Darkshore
  tip Learn the Auberdine flight path on the hill south of the inn, then cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; the Great Bear Spirit sits in the woods to the north-west. Learn the Moonglade flight path in Nighthaven and fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine).
  getfp "Auberdine"
  zone Moonglade
  turnin 5921                                 -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 5929
  complete 5929 @39.1,27.5                    -- Speak with the Great Bear Spirit
  turnin 5929
  accept 5931
  getfp "Moonglade"
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Back to Darnassus
  only Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up from Rut'theran Village to Mathrengyl in the Cenarion Enclave.
  turnin 5931                                 -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  accept 6001

step The Moonkin Stone
  only Druid
  zone Darkshore
  tip Go back down to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine. The Moonkin Stone stands in the hills just east of the village: use the Cenarion Moondust there, defeat Lunaclaw and speak to the Lunaclaw Spirit.
  fly "Auberdine"
  use 15208 @43.5,46.0                        -- Cenarion Moondust
  complete 6001

step Body and Heart
  only Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Fly to Rut'theran Village once more and take the portal up to Mathrengyl, then fly back to Auberdine for the boat.
  fly "Rut'theran Village"
  turnin 6001                                 -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Bear Form
  fly "Auberdine"

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip Laird's fish stall is by the docks. Then take the boat to Stormwind.
  turnin 6342                                 -- Laird
  goto 30.76,40.92 "Boat to Stormwind"
  note From Stormwind Harbor, ride through the city gates into Elwynn Forest and follow the road west to Westfall.

